{"v":"2026-08-27","f":[{"i":"AIIOT3","n":"Under Negotiation: Chagos Archipelago Marine Protected Area","c":"Chagos Archipelago - British Indian Ocean Territory","d":"Marine Protected Area","k":1,"l":4,"rf":2,"hl":2,"tr":1,"sp":1,"an":3,"en":3,"dv":3,"pu":"To ensure the future protection of this unique environment featuring some of the most biodiverse waters on the planet with over 220 species coral, 855 species of fish and 355 species of molluscs. Due to the political status of this site, it is not included in our Level of Fishing Protection calcula…","re":"The United Kingdom declared this MPA as a no-take marine reserve in 2010, prohibiting all commercial fishing and extractive activities. Following litigation brought by the Republic of Mauritius, in 2015 an arbitral tribunal held that the declaration of the MPA was not in accordance with the provisions of the United Nations Convention on the Law of the Sea, and has left it to the parties to enter into the negotiation…","rn":"AWARD IN THE MATTER OF THE CHAGOS MARINE PROTECTED AREA ARBITRATION, AN ARBITRAL TRIBUNAL CONSTITUTED UNDER ANNEX VII OF THE UNITED NATIONS CONVENTION ON THE L…","rs":"","ma":"British Indian Ocean Territory Commissioner","se":"Year-round","u":"2026-04-16","pm":100,"b":[-10.79674,67.88313,-2.28834,75.85287],"g":[[[[-5.23039,75.83452],[-5.19002,75.83489],[-5.14906,75.83429],[-5.07601,75.83231],[-5.00302,75.82876],[-4.93012,75.82362],[-4.85736,75.8169],[-4.78475,75.8086],[-4.71235,75.79873],[-4.64018,75.78729],[-4.60832,75.78193],[-4.56827,75.7743],[-4.49667,75.75974],[-4.4254,75.74364],[-4.3545,75.726],[-4.284,75.70683],[-4.21393,75.68614],[-4.14434,75.66394],[-4.07524,75.64024],[-4.04451,75.62936],[-4.01549,75.61847],[-3.96497,75.59899],[-3.89825,75.57225],[-3.81601,75.53759],[-3.76166,75.51336],[-3.70775,75.48817],[-3.6543,75.46204],[-3.60132,75.43497],[-3.54884,75.40698],[-3.47401,75.36512],[-3.43962,75.34474],[-3.37728,75.30678],[-3.31123,75.26443],[-3.28383,75.09126],[-3.15524,74.26418],[-3